the first time around was
like a lot of motivation

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.040
and like, it's gonna be great.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:37.073
We're gonna out of this
on top, number one.

00:00:37.073 --> 00:00:40.350
Now I'm waiting for the civil war

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.110
but in the meantime, also, you know,

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.870
writing and exploring myself and things

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:52.870
and just traveling, writing
COVID as much as I can

00:00:55.707 --> 00:00:58.380
