00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:01.040
I heard that's actually
working really well.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:02.480
You've been traveling, you were on a plane

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:04.017
I was watching your
stories and I was like.

00:01:04.017 --> 00:01:04.850
(speaker gasps)

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:05.683
[Jenny] I was.

00:01:05.683 --> 00:01:07.820
