that experience right now?

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:09.350
I had a whole row to myself.

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:10.183
It was great.

00:01:10.183 --> 00:01:11.493
Everything came in a bag.

00:01:13.025 --> 00:01:16.210
