00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:17.670
We travel a lot for stand up

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:19.690
so you're always in like a middle seat

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:22.540
or whatever is the cheapest
seat to get wherever we are.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:26.430
But now it's a little nice
slash absolutely terrifying.

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:28.410
So you have whole row to yourself.

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:29.753
I have the whole row to myself.

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:33.510
All the snacks come in a bag.

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:35.080
Don't they always come in a bag?

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:36.481
Are or people on a Delta flight

00:01:36.481 --> 00:01:38.320
