Come in like a little bag.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:41.780
Literally bring you a bag
full of water and snacks.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:43.360
Oh, so everything's together.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:45.410
So it's just one thing
you have to (indistinct)

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:46.950
Okay, I thought in flights before

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:49.730
people just throwing you loose M&amp;Ms.

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:50.563
Get it!

00:01:50.563 --> 00:01:52.480
We're all looking around
for that one person

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:54.170
