00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.370
We're all looking.

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:56.700
Yeah, was there any?

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.160
I did it?

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:00.360
No. (laughs)

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.210
Are you able to breathe in the mask

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:04.000
