Alan to approve the account.

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:02.310
Not anymore, you could literally just

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.640
go to LAX, get on a
plane, go to destination

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:05.880
and then from there just fly back

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.550
just 'cause you want some peace and quiet

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:08.640
and some free snacks.

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:09.473
That's great.

00:03:09.473 --> 00:03:13.730
So how are you handling
the second quarantine?

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:16.358
So I feel like there are some things

00:03:16.358 --> 00:03:18.780
that I'm gonna do and people can do

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:20.810
to make second quarantine better.

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:25.550
So first thing is, I'm not gonna be lazy

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:27.650
in just some lounge wear and just whatever

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:29.130
like I put on makeup.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.990
I got new quarantine glasses.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:32.920
I wanna show you my
new quarantine glasses.

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.142
[Moses] Oh, debut.

00:03:34.142 --> 00:03:34.975
Boom!

00:03:34.975 --> 00:03:37.320
Wild crazy Jenny right here.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:40.090
No one can make fun of you,
when you're in your own house.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:43.550
Nope it's just me, my wild glasses.

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:46.650
And then so okay, so I've also started

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:48.240
I was like, okay I'm gonna be better cook

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:51.720
so like I moved and I got
this really nice new kitchen

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:55.570
that I can just cook in that's
why I have all pots and pans.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.506
You rude motherfucker.

00:03:57.506 --> 00:03:58.490
(laughs)

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:00.390
I did roast you at the
beginning for your pans

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:02.320
just before we got on the call.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:05.057
So also get a hobby, my hobby now

00:04:05.057 --> 00:04:08.393
is I sell vintage clothing,
so those are my mannequins.

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:12.230
To make income and a
hobby that keeps your mind

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:16.150
off of, what's going on in the world

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.780
and how things are unsafe.

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:19.260
I got this brand new big living room

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:21.190
you can see it got like a gallery wall

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:24.350
and like all this cool stuff, so-

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:26.150
Wait, what was that?

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:27.250
What?

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.710
There's like someone, is that someone

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:29.720
