00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:30.900
My gallery wall?

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:32.640
I put up all my pictures.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:33.550
Can you see?

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:34.990
Yeah, no, that's great.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:35.823
But what was that?

00:04:35.823 --> 00:04:37.340
Is there someone there with you?

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:41.300
Oh, Oh, you mean that?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:46.300
Oh, yeah, is that a Trader Joe's employee?

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:49.260
Okay, look, I wanted to
save this one for last.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:53.300
So hobby is important, you
know, fine getting your finances

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:55.610
but I think the most important thing to do

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:59.120
during the second
quarantine is you know what?

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.320
You gotta find a friend.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:04.280
I was alone the whole first
quarantine not anymore.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.560
Now I'm free now.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:07.670
This is Dave.

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:09.820
I picked him up at Trader Joe's

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:12.360
